<p>Karte the ro ro ke ye hazrat bayaa&rsquo;n ,tod gaye meri kamar bhaijaa&rsquo;n<br />
Roti hai qaime me sakina waha&rsquo;n, sote hai abbas zamee&rsquo;n par yahaa&rsquo;n</p>

<p>Mar gaya akber pidar , thaam lo meri kamar<br />
Sadqe karo lash par, lut gaya bekas ka ghar<br />
Quwwate baazu mera kya hogaya zeenate pehlu mera kya ho gaya<br />
Aashaqe dikju mera kya hogaya kya hua afsos mera qadr daa&rsquo;n</p>

<p>Humko sambhaalega koun laash uthayega koun <br />
Bhai pukaarega koun, qabr banaayega koun<br />
Kya hua saqqae sakina ko aah, kisne kiya mera bhara ghar tabaah<br />
Kya hui abase baraadar ki chah, ab gayi to pyaar ki baaei&rsquo;n kahaa&rsquo;n</p>

<p>Koun qabar le meri , haaye meri Bekasi<br />
Talq hui zindagi, chalti hai dil par churi<br />
Todo na ghurbat me meri aas utho , dekho husain aaya hai abbas utho<br />
Rota hai mazloom basad yaas utho, utho bas ab ghar me chalo bhaijaa&rsquo;n</p>

<p>Aankho ka taara mera , ghar ka ujaala mera<br />
Aashiqo shaida mera, chand ka tukda mera<br />
Roohe ali jaane nabi alvida, aashiqo shaidaae aqi alvida<br />
Laashae abbase ali alvida, aate hai ab hum bhi chalo bhaijaa&rsquo;n<br />
</p>